  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maharashtra Agribusiness Network Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project targets to support FPOs by improving a network of post-harvest marketing and value chains focusing on the horticulture crops identified in the pre-feasibility study.  The project design reflects the lessons learned from the previous projects and comprises separate components for public sector infrastructure development and private sector investment support. ADB will add value through an integrated approach addressing capacity development, financial support, and infrastructure development.</narrative>
  </description>
